{"4071300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "My True North", "steam_appid": 4071300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The World Has Changed.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And Humanity?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>My True North</i></strong> - a branching dramatic saga about the tragic aesthetic of this life, unfolding in a world of a classic (almost) zombie apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>MTN</i></strong> weaves into a single tangled web stories of survival, bloody carnage, and the search for yourself. And somewhere right beside it - there is even Love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>So very beautiful...</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/67752afa5251d82539c35a3a33dab48f.poster.avif?t=1775076188\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/67752afa5251d82539c35a3a33dab48f.webm?t=1775076188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/67752afa5251d82539c35a3a33dab48f.mp4?t=1775076188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    - A complex narrative with ambiguous moral and ethical choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   - Length of the first chapter - 2-3 hours of gameplay.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/2c584a209fb988860226086d50e1bc47.poster.avif?t=1775076188\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/2c584a209fb988860226086d50e1bc47.webm?t=1775076188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/2c584a209fb988860226086d50e1bc47.mp4?t=1775076188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   - A meticulously crafted universe of a world that has already seen its end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   - A series format where each subsequent chapter continues the previous one.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/a0b2c953405a05dfa54ee7ef90f8392f.poster.avif?t=1775076188\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/a0b2c953405a05dfa54ee7ef90f8392f.webm?t=1775076188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/a0b2c953405a05dfa54ee7ef90f8392f.mp4?t=1775076188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   - Dozens of minutes of a unique, multi-genre Soundtrack, created especially for MTN (and that's just in the first chapter - there's more to come).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   - Complex characters, each with something to hide and something to believe in.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/4976d5a488c986d79bbbee90613f68f9.poster.avif?t=1775076188\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/4976d5a488c986d79bbbee90613f68f9.webm?t=1775076188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/4976d5a488c986d79bbbee90613f68f9.mp4?t=1775076188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   - A vibrant visual style, on the edge of stylization and realism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   - Variability of narrative choices, a system for building relationships with characters and with your own self.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/9a2705f9971fa9c6706db929619ee1f3.poster.avif?t=1775076188\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/9a2705f9971fa9c6706db929619ee1f3.webm?t=1775076188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/9a2705f9971fa9c6706db929619ee1f3.mp4?t=1775076188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    - Multiple possible endings in future chapters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    - No bad ends and... no happy ones.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/b78d06a0859b8b85eac9224e757bce6d.poster.avif?t=1775076188\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/b78d06a0859b8b85eac9224e757bce6d.webm?t=1775076188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/b78d06a0859b8b85eac9224e757bce6d.mp4?t=1775076188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first chapter already here. Subsequent chapters are currently in active development, and you will see new content this very year.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We believe in the best and would be grateful for any feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And remember - <strong>Never Surrender</strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/d66542f793a6d5abbacfe77a7d2507ff.poster.avif?t=1775076188\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/d66542f793a6d5abbacfe77a7d2507ff.webm?t=1775076188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/d66542f793a6d5abbacfe77a7d2507ff.mp4?t=1775076188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The World Has Changed.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And Humanity?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>My True North</i></strong> - a branching dramatic saga about the tragic aesthetic of this life, unfolding in a world of a classic (almost) zombie apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>MTN</i></strong> weaves into a single tangled web stories of survival, bloody carnage, and the search for yourself. And somewhere right beside it - there is even Love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>So very beautiful...</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/67752afa5251d82539c35a3a33dab48f.poster.avif?t=1775076188\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/67752afa5251d82539c35a3a33dab48f.webm?t=1775076188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/67752afa5251d82539c35a3a33dab48f.mp4?t=1775076188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    - A complex narrative with ambiguous moral and ethical choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   - Length of the first chapter - 2-3 hours of gameplay.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/2c584a209fb988860226086d50e1bc47.poster.avif?t=1775076188\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/2c584a209fb988860226086d50e1bc47.webm?t=1775076188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/2c584a209fb988860226086d50e1bc47.mp4?t=1775076188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   - A meticulously crafted universe of a world that has already seen its end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   - A series format where each subsequent chapter continues the previous one.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/a0b2c953405a05dfa54ee7ef90f8392f.poster.avif?t=1775076188\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/a0b2c953405a05dfa54ee7ef90f8392f.webm?t=1775076188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/a0b2c953405a05dfa54ee7ef90f8392f.mp4?t=1775076188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   - Dozens of minutes of a unique, multi-genre Soundtrack, created especially for MTN (and that's just in the first chapter - there's more to come).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   - Complex characters, each with something to hide and something to believe in.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/4976d5a488c986d79bbbee90613f68f9.poster.avif?t=1775076188\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/4976d5a488c986d79bbbee90613f68f9.webm?t=1775076188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/4976d5a488c986d79bbbee90613f68f9.mp4?t=1775076188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   - A vibrant visual style, on the edge of stylization and realism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   - Variability of narrative choices, a system for building relationships with characters and with your own self.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/9a2705f9971fa9c6706db929619ee1f3.poster.avif?t=1775076188\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/9a2705f9971fa9c6706db929619ee1f3.webm?t=1775076188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/9a2705f9971fa9c6706db929619ee1f3.mp4?t=1775076188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    - Multiple possible endings in future chapters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    - No bad ends and... no happy ones.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/b78d06a0859b8b85eac9224e757bce6d.poster.avif?t=1775076188\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/b78d06a0859b8b85eac9224e757bce6d.webm?t=1775076188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/b78d06a0859b8b85eac9224e757bce6d.mp4?t=1775076188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first chapter already here. Subsequent chapters are currently in active development, and you will see new content this very year.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We believe in the best and would be grateful for any feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And remember - <strong>Never Surrender</strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/d66542f793a6d5abbacfe77a7d2507ff.poster.avif?t=1775076188\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/d66542f793a6d5abbacfe77a7d2507ff.webm?t=1775076188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/extras/d66542f793a6d5abbacfe77a7d2507ff.mp4?t=1775076188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "My True North - a nonlinear visual novel about Personal Choice of a Human, Love, and the Journey to Yourself in a world of the living dead. Watch. Love. And don't go under the ice. Especially in the height of summer.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian", "reviews": "“Глубокая и трогательная визуальная новелла о любви, выборе и самопознании в мрачном мире. Атмосфера захватывает, а финал оставляет сильное впечатление. Обязательно к прохождению!”<br>Sokol-curator \t<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/866d95adc763b7d00393481f1fad5576215a4a56/header.jpg?t=1775076188", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/6a83c3b43cb0acf590f9cc099120b809efcc0a24/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775076188", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071300/6a83c3b43cb0acf590f9cc099120b809efcc0a24/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775076188", "website": null, "p